tle": "La religi\u00f3n de Dune", "pagenum": "731"}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Ap\u00e9ndice III", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 3, "label": "", "title": "Informe sobre los motivos y prop\u00f3sitos de la Bene Gesserit", "pagenum": "743"}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Ap\u00e9ndice IV", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 3, "label": "", "title": "El almanaque Al-Ashraf (extractos seleccionados de las casas nobles)", "pagenum": "747"}, {"level": 3, "label": "", "title": "Terminolog\u00eda del Imperio", "pagenum": "751"}, {"level": 3, "label": "", "title": "Notas cartogr\u00e1ficas", "pagenum": "779"}], "isbn_10": ["9877254115"], "isbn_13": ["9789877254112"], "dewey_decimal_class": ["813"], "description": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "En el des\u00e9rtico planeta Arrakis, el agua es el bien m\u00e1s preciado y llorar a los muertos, el s\u00edmbolo de m\u00e1xima prodigalidad. Pero algo hace de Arrakis una pieza estrat\u00e9gica para los intereses del Emperador, las Grandes Casas y la Cofrad\u00eda, los tres grandes poderes de la galaxia. Arrakis es el \u00fanico origen conocido de la melange, preciosa especia y uno de los bienes m\u00e1s codiciados del universo.\r\n\r\nAl duque Leto Atreides se le asigna el gobierno de este mundo inh\u00f3spito, habitado por los ind\u00f3mitos Fremen y monstruosos gusanos de arena de centenares de metros de longitud. Sin embargo, cuando la familia es traicionada, su hijo y heredero, Paul, emprender\u00e1 un viaje hacia un destino m\u00e1s grande del que jam\u00e1s hubiese podido so\u00f1ar.\r\n\r\nMezcla fascinante de aventura, misticismo, intrigas pol\u00edticas y ecologismo, Dune se convirti\u00f3, desde el momento de su publicaci\u00f3n, en un fen\u00f3meno de culto y en la mayor epopeya de ciencia-ficci\u00f3n de todos los tiempos."}, "latest_revision": 10, "revision": 10, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2022-07-15T21:28:39.425216"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2026-03-02T05:27:44.599431"}}, {"works": [{"key": "/works/OL893415W"}], "title": "Dune", "publishers": ["Hodder Paperbacks"], "publish_date": "2015", "key": "/books/OL51750372M", "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "identifiers": {}, "covers": [14636170], "isbn_13": ["9781473696211"], "classifications": {}, "edition_name": "50th Anniversary Edition", "series": ["Dune"], "languages": [{"key": "/languages/eng"}], "physical_format": "Paperback", "latest_revision": 3, "revision": 3, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2024-06-15T15:46:57.767804"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2024-06-15T15:50:59.937759"}}, {"works": [{"key": "/works/OL893415W"}], "title": "Diuna", "publishers": ["Dom wydawniczy Rebis"], "publish_date": "2020", "key": "/books/OL50530390M", "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "identifiers": {}, "classifications": {}, "publish_places": ["Pozna\u0144, Polska"], "copyright_date": "1965", "series": ["Kroniki Diuny"], "languages": [{"key": "/languages/pol"}], "physical_format": "eBook", "number_of_pages": 607, "covers": [14563320], "table_of_contents": [{"level": 1, "label": "", "title": "Dedykacja", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 1, "label": "", "title": "Ksi\u0119ga 1. DIUNA", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Pocz\u0105tek to czas dla podj\u0119cia\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Pr\u00f3bowa\u0107 zrozumie\u0107 Muad\u2019Diba\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Tak rzek\u0142a \u015bw. Alia od No\u017ca\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Przeczytali\u015bcie, \u017ce Muad\u2019Dib\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "YUEH (y\u00fc\u2019e) Wellington (wel\u2019ing-tun)\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Jak podej\u015b\u0107 do studi\u00f3w nad\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Z pojawieniem si\u0119 lady Jessiki\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Yueh! Yueh! Yueh! \u2013 brzmi refren\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Wielu podkre\u015bla szybko\u015b\u0107\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "C\u00f3\u017c takiego podtrzymywa\u0142o\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "M\u00f3wi si\u0119, \u017ce ksi\u0105\u017c\u0119 Leto zamkn\u0105\u0142\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Ponad wyj\u015bciem na p\u0142yt\u0119 l\u0105dowiska\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Owego pierwszego dnia, kiedy\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Chyba nie ma straszliwszego\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Pewnego dnia ojciec m\u00f3j\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Wielko\u015b\u0107 to chwilowe prze\u017cycie\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Nie ma ucieczki \u2013 p\u0142acimy za\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Czy walczysz z marami? Czy\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Powinna istnie\u0107 nauka goryczy\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Arrakis naucza filozofii no\u017ca\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Legenda g\u0142osi, \u017ce kiedy ksi\u0105\u017c\u0119\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "O morza Kaladanu, O ludzie\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 1, "label": "", "title": "Ksi\u0119ga 2. MUAD\u2019DIB", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Kiedy m\u00f3j ojciec, Padyszach\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Ojciec powiedzia\u0142 mi kiedy\u015b\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Muad\u2019Dib rzeczywi\u015bcie widzia\u0142\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Czym gardzisz? Po tym pozna\u0107\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "W wieku pi\u0119tnastu lat nauczy\u0142 si\u0119\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Pochodzimy z Kaladanu \u2013 rajskiego\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Wielu ludziom trudno zrozumie\u0107\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Owa religijna adaptacja Fremen\u00f3w\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Proroctwo i widzenie przysz\u0142o\u015bci\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Fremeni w najdoskonalszym stopniu\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "M\u00f3j ojciec, Padyszach Imperator\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "B\u00f3g stworzy\u0142 Arrakis, by\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Poj\u0119cie post\u0119pu dzia\u0142a jak\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Muad\u2019Dib powiada nam w Porze\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "D\u0142o\u0144 dr\u017cy, wargi dr\u017c\u0105, Idee\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 1, "label": "", "title": "Ksi\u0119ga 3. PROROK", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "\u017badna kobieta, \u017caden m\u0119\u017cczyzna\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "G\u0142\u0119boko w ludzkiej nie\u015bwiadomo\u015bci\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "We wszystkich rzeczach przewija\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Trzymajcie w r\u0119ku mennice i s\u0105dy\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Nie da si\u0119 unikn\u0105\u0107 wzajemnych\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Kiedy religia po\u0142\u0105czy w jedno\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Jak\u017ce cz\u0119sto jest tak, \u017ce wybuch\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "I sta\u0142o si\u0119 w roku trzecim\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "I za\u015bwita\u0142 taki dzie\u0144, w kt\u00f3rym\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "I stan\u0105\u0142 przed nimi Muad\u2019Dib\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "By\u0142 wojownikiem i mistykiem\u2026", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 1, "label": "", "title": "DODATKI", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "I. Ekologia Diuny", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "II. Religia Diuny", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "III. Raport o motywach i celach Bene Gesserit", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "IV. Almanak en-Aszraf", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Terminologia Imperium", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Nota kartograficzna", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 2, "label": "", "title": "Mapa Arrakis", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 1, "label": "", "title": "\u201eKroniki Diuny\u201d", "pagenum": ""}], "contributors": [{"role": "Translator", "name": "Marek Marsza\u0142"}], "translation_of": "Dune", "translated_from": [{"key": "/languages/eng"}], "isbn_13": ["9788381887533"], "edition_name": "Wydanie II e-book (opracowane na podstawie wydania ksi\u0105\u017ckowego: Diuna, wyd. III poprawione, Pozna\u0144 2020)", "latest_revision": 5, "revision": 5, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2024-01-05T15:21:43.826523"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2024-02-29T08:39:28.380588"}}, {"title": "Dune", "publish_date": "1995", "publishers": ["P&J"], "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "covers": [12794170], "isbn_10": ["840100912X"], "languages": [{"key": "/languages/spa"}], "source_records": ["amazon:840100912X"], "key": "/books/OL38247253M", "works": [{"key": "/works/OL893415W"}], "latest_revision": 5, "revision": 5, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2022-06-16T10:54:41.671076"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2023-02-16T15:06:47.416532"}}, {"works": [{"key": "/works/OL893415W"}], "title": "Der W\u00fcstenp